    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Jul 2024 13:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期播客的主题是医疗中的DRG（Diagnosis-related group）概念，旨在讨论DRG2.0时代下的看病问题，重点讲解了DRG的政策。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> DRG的定义，它实际上是一种病例的分类方案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">04:03</a> DRG体系的构成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">05:49</a> 距离冠心病讲解DRG付费模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="414">06:54</a> DRG适用范围</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="724">12:04</a> DRG费用确定方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="892">14:52</a> DRG费用调整</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1033">17:13</a> 急危重症的特殊管理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1352">22:32</a> DRG2.0的不同之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 利好患者方的几个要点</span></p><span></span><p><span>DRG核心26组</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq46ILQk-9XsRzHU9nS-dkUuy8-r.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>命名规则</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftd6-CzwYqnOpDV0v4I3pi03ck9m.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>本期参考文献：</span></em></p><span></span><blockquote><em><span>Wikipedia contributors. (2024, May 7). Diagnosis-related group. In Wikipedia, The Free Encyclopedia. Retrieved 10: 22, July 28, 2024, from </span></em><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Diagnosis-related_group&amp;oldid=1222683295" data-url="https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Diagnosis-related_group&amp;oldid=1222683295"><em><span>en.wikipedia.org</span></em></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2019-11/18/content_5562261.htm" data-url="https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2019-11/18/content_5562261.htm"><em><span>关于印发疾病诊断相关分组（DRG）付费国家试点技术规范和分组方案的通知_国务院部门文件_中国政府网 (www.gov.cn)</span></em></a></blockquote><span></span><p><span>第二期播客，在吸取第一期播客的教训后，改善了工作流，在前期改善了部分录音环境，后期过程中也添加了降噪的处理，希望能带来更好的听感。过程中也收获了很多音频处理方面的支持，很是尤其，更是有用。</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系方式：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>outlook2639986406@163.com</span></blockquote>]]></description>
